From: Domenico D'Arrigo <DCHEM88@hotmail.it>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:58:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mb/lenovo/haswell: Enable ACPI charge behaviour on the W541

The OEM firmware of the W541 (GNETxxWW, shared with the W540) provides
the HKEY battery methods that coreboot implements for the T440p:
BICG/BICS for inhibit-charge and BDSG/BDSS for force-discharge. Both
boards already share the H8 battery threshold implementation at EC
offset 0xb0.

The two boards run different EC firmware (W541: GMHTxxWW, T440p:
GLHTxxWW), but their OEM DSDTs (TP-GN, TP-GL) declare the same EC RAM
map: the 146 fields of the T440p at the same offsets, with the same
sizes and names; the W541 adds four flags at 0xff. Both implement the
four methods through the same SMI (PSIF, function 5 of SMI 0x14), and
the registers used here are where both maps leave them to that code:
bits 0-5 of 0x0f and 0x20-0x22 unnamed, 0xb0-0xb7 declared but not
used by the AML (HDEN, HDEP). The thresholds that coreboot already
writes on this board are the first four of those bytes.

Select H8_HAS_BAT_CHARGE_BEHAVIOUR for both variants instead of the
T440p only. See commit d2c02ab35737 ("mb/lenovo/t440p: Enable ACPI
charge behaviour"). Note that the AC detach handler writes 0xb4/0xb5.

TEST=Built for the W541; the EC maps of the two OEM DSDTs compared as
above. Not run on the W541 yet.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/Kconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/Kconfig b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/Kconfig
index b65cd785..9f918e06 100644
--- a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/Kconfig
+++ b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/Kconfig
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@ config BOARD_LENOVO_HASWELL_COMMON
 	select EC_LENOVO_PMH7
 	select H8_ACTIVE_TRIP_FROM_GNVS
 	select H8_CFR_MAINBOARD_FORMS
+	select H8_HAS_BAT_CHARGE_BEHAVIOUR
 	select H8_HAS_BAT_THRESHOLDS_IMPL
 	select H8_HAS_BAT_INFO_EXTENDED
 	select H8_HAS_LEDLOGO
@@ -32,7 +33,6 @@ config BOARD_LENOVO_HASWELL_COMMON
 
 config BOARD_LENOVO_THINKPAD_T440P
 	select BOARD_LENOVO_HASWELL_COMMON
-	select H8_HAS_BAT_CHARGE_BEHAVIOUR
 	select DRIVERS_REALTEK_RTSX_PCI_CARDREADER
 
 config BOARD_LENOVO_THINKPAD_W541
